  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three current-carrying parallel wires, P, Q, and R, each of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> are shown in the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The current in P is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2I\"></span> and the current in both Q and R is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span>. The separation of P and Q is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2X\"></span> and the separation of P and R is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3X\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the net electric force on wire Q? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\mu_{0}I^{2}L}{2\\pi R}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2\\mu_{0}I^{2}L}{\\pi R}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\mu_{0}I^{2}L}{\\pi R}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
